OL,3,GNEWSAHarry leaves Nottingham with
OL,4,Athumbs-up as he and Meghan round out
OL,5,Afirst joint visit since UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are met
OL,8,Fwith cheers and shouts of "I love you"
OL,9,Fas they tour Nottingham on their first
OL,10,Froyal-style joint engagement since
OL,11,Freturning to the UK
OL,13,FHarry and Meghan just visited youth
OL,14,Fcharity Epic Partners, the third stop
OL,15,Fon their visit. Outside was Rafi
OL,16,FRashad, 20, a student from Indonesia
OL,17,Fwho is studying in the UK: "I saw them
OL,18,Fholding hands with each other which was
OL,19,Fvery nice."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
