OL,3,GNEWSAHarry leaves Nottingham with
OL,4,Athumbs-up as he and Meghan round out
OL,5,Afirst joint visit since UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier they took part in a cooking
OL,8,Fclass at Himmah, an organisation
OL,9,Ftackling food poverty. The Duchess was
OL,10,Falso reunited with her "ladies", who
OL,11,Fshe worked with on a cookbook in 2018
OL,13,F"It was really, really meaningful," she
OL,14,Ftells our senior royal correspondent,
OL,15,Fwhile Harry says it's "great to be back
OL,16,Fin Nottingham"
OL,18,FTheir first stop was the Community
OL,19,FRecording Studio (CRS) charity, a place
OL,20,FHarry has a long relationship with
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
